1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:09,600
Please stop advocating for people to be president if you're not also advocating for the system they'd be president of to be dismantled.

2
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:14,860
I see this all the time. Like we want this person to be president or they should run for office, et cetera, et cetera, et cetera.

3
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:22,340
How do you think they're going to actually change anything when the system they'd be going into is so much bigger than them?

4
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:27,780
You cannot change a system with an individual. It doesn't work.

5
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:33,580
You have to change the system from the bottom up. And guess who's at the bottom of the system? Us.

